        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Texas hold'em it is. You're heads-up against the dealer. I've posted your small blind of 10 and the dealer's big blind of 20, so the pot is 30 and you have 10 to call. Your bankroll is 990 after the blind.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### texas-holdem (resource)\\ntexas hold'em, hole cards, flop, turn, river, community cards\\n\\nHeads-up hold'em against the dealer: two hole cards each, then a shared flop (three cards), turn, and river, with a betting round before each street — check, bet, call, raise, or fold, staked from the running chip count. Best five-card hand from the seven wins the pot, standard rankings (high card up to royal flush). Reveal both hands honestly at showdown.\\n\\nLet's play Texas hold'em.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-croupier-card-table-round\",\"frontier-round-outcome\",\"wallet-summary-card\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":142000,\"total\":57681,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":25605},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":20517},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":4794},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":1532},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":5088}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":4716,\"outputTokens\":4137,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":17507,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"card-game-sheet\",\"card-layout\",\"login-form\"],\"cacheBoundary\":46267}}}",
